# AssetVerse

**Corporate Asset Management System (B2B HR & Employee Platform)**

---

## 🚀 Overview

AssetVerse is a full-stack HR & asset management system that helps companies track, assign, and manage physical assets (laptops, chairs, keyboards, etc.) across employees with role-based access and subscription limits.

---

## 🌐 Live URL


---

## 🎯 Key Features

### 👨‍💼 HR (Admin)

* Company registration & subscription packages
* Add / edit / delete assets
* Approve or reject asset requests
* Manage employees & affiliations
* Stripe-based package upgrade
* Dashboard analytics (charts)

### 👨‍💻 Employee

* Multi-company affiliation support
* Request assets from multiple companies
* View assigned assets
* Return returnable assets
* Profile management

### 🔐 Authentication

* JWT authentication
* Role-based access (HR / Employee)
* Protected routes
* Persistent login on refresh

---

## 📦 Core Modules

* Asset management (CRUD)
* Request & approval workflow
* Employee affiliation system
* Subscription package system
* Payment integration (Stripe)

---

## 🛠 Tech Stack

**Frontend:** React, Tailwind CSS, DaisyUI, React Query, Recharts, Axios

**Backend:** Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB, JWT, Stripe, CORS, dotenv

---

## 🗄 Database Collections

* users
* assets
* requests
* assignedAssets
* employeeAffiliations
* packages
* payments

---

## ⚙ Environment Variables

**Client:**

```
VITE_API_URL=your_backend_url
VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=your_key
```

**Server:**

```
PORT=5000
MONGODB_URI=your_mongo_uri
JWT_SECRET=your_secret
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=your_key
```

